{"title":"2006 SMT/Advanced Topics Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_SMT/Advanced_Topics_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Evaluate: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/7/fa752e0810baf389ff7f456d5164db030ea87add.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{k\\sqrt{k+2}+(k+2)\\sqrt{k}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"200\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_SMT/Advanced_Topics_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We try to rationalize the denominators. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/9/5396e977d11eca26d5330489dc54d0129db83146.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{k\\sqrt{k+2}+(k+2)\\sqrt{k}}=\\frac{k\\sqrt{k+2}-(k+2)\\sqrt{k}}{(k\\sqrt{k+2})^2-((k+2)\\sqrt{k})^2}=\\frac{(k+2)\\sqrt{k}-k\\sqrt{k+2}}{2(k)(k+2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"610\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nNow, since the denominator is factorable, we try decomposing the fraction. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/0/ee09a0a6d96e83c669d3f5b1d2d5c299455e79e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(k+2)\\sqrt{k}-k\\sqrt{k+2}}{2(k)(k+2)}=\\frac{(k+2)\\sqrt{k}}{2(k)(k+2)}-\\frac{k\\sqrt{k+2}}{2(k)(k+2)}=\\frac{\\sqrt{k}}{2k}-\\frac{\\sqrt{k+2}}{2(k+2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"548\" height=\"46\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nFinally, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/094635d96d2e1addabe89ac8d00742f788d35dc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{k}}{2k}-\\frac{\\sqrt{k+2}}{2(k+2)}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6}+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}-\\frac{2}{8}+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6}-\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{14}+\\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"493\" height=\"53\" />. From here, we see that everything cancels except for the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/1/321b51dda10eb639de6799997916e2443952d3ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"26\" height=\"41\" />, so our final answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/1/ce11c5b4c1b84e0dabf3df437712f44c9d169a7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}=\\boxed{\\frac{2+\\sqrt{2}}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"159\" height=\"53\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_SMT/Advanced_Topics_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_SMT/Advanced_Topics_Problems\" title=\"2006 SMT/Advanced Topics Problems\">2006 SMT/Advanced Topics Problems</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017211859\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.023 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 43/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1827/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:11180:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017211859 and revision id 47193. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}